      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Only one side of the partition is searched. Work per round: c n (1 + 3/4 + 9/16 + ...) <= 4 c n.\nA good pivot takes 2 tries on average, so E[T(n)] <= 8 c n = O(n)",
      "originalText": "Only one side of the partition is searched. Work per round: c n (1 + 3/4 + 9/16 + ...) <= 4 c n.\nA good pivot takes 2 tries on average, so E[T(n)] <= 8 c n = O(n)",
